# TEST FIXTURE (id 94): the C4-A world systems (contract section 35): a DARK cave (@dark yes: only a small diamond around the hero is drawn without the Linterna module,
# flag 89), a ghost map (@ghosts yes), arrow floors (straight run, redirect, loop, into a solid NPC, into a boulder, screen-cardinal facings with the corner rule) and an elevator
# (the PC at (15,12): a three-row floor list, then a warp inside the map; the PC at (13,12): a five-row list). Not part of the game: reached only by the host harness (tools/host_world, `make c4sys`).
# Arrows: `>` SE (+i)  `<` NW (-i)  `v` SW (+j)  `^` NE (-j)  `s` S (+1,+1)  `e` E (+1,-1).  Variables: c4_pick (the elevator's row), c4_cnt (the Registro's count).
@map test_c4sys
@size 18 14
@interior no
@cave yes
@dark yes
@ghosts yes
@bg 3
@fill cave
@spawn start 1 1 S
@var c4_pick 5
@var c4_cnt 6
@legend
  .  tile=cave
  b  tile=cave object=boulder
  >  tile=arrow_se
  <  tile=arrow_nw
  v  tile=arrow_sw
  ^  tile=arrow_ne
  s  tile=arrow_s
  e  tile=arrow_e
  N  tile=cave npc=vecino id=guard face=S text=c4a.test.signal
  L  tile=cave object=pc interact=look script=lift
  M  tile=cave object=pc interact=look script=lift5
@grid
  ..................
  ....>>>...........
  ..........>v......
  ...>>v....^<......
  .....v............
  ..b..v.......b....
  .........s...e..b.
  ..........s.......
  ...>>N............
  ..................
  ...>>b............
  ..................
  .......b.....M.L..
  ..................
@script lift interact
    say gl.c4a.elev.ask
    elevator c4_pick gl.c4a.floor.b1 gl.c4a.floor.f1 gl.c4a.floor.f2
    jv c4_pick 255 stay
    jv c4_pick 0 f0
    jv c4_pick 1 f1
    warp test_c4sys 15 2 S
  f0:
    warp test_c4sys 2 12 S
  f1:
    warp test_c4sys 8 12 S
  stay:
    say c4a.test.signal
@end
@script lift5 interact
    elevator c4_pick gl.c4a.floor.b4 gl.c4a.floor.b3 gl.c4a.floor.b2 gl.c4a.floor.b1 gl.c4a.floor.f1
@end
@script count called
    caught_count c4_cnt
@end
@script count_ge called
    caught_ge c4_cnt 10
@end
